{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Narrative</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/754d94a000375d1acf9112d04b3e8c3f.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1520 height=844 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a deeply emotional, story-driven journey, told through evocative visuals, haunting music, and subtle environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill Yet Engaging Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/59230bed86baef5f57c88445852e807f.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a simple but weighty combat system that flows naturally with exploration, keeping the tension without overwhelming you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/055cae51460f0ac256a828f3c1c2e7c7.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Wield an arsenal of weapons, from close-range melee tools to ranged firearms, to fend off the shadowy figures lurking in Yus\u2019s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mind Like No Other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/43dd564004b3fabb8cec340e1d12bf6a.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Step into an environment shaped entirely by Yus\u2019s thoughts, a place where reality twists, logic bends, and nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles with Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/28339ae6f0359e7699ce6fd8386f70a6.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Within this surreal world lie mysterious puzzles, even Yus himself doesn\u2019t understand them. Solve them to uncover secrets and help him confront his deepest fears.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961950?t=1758555736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/a2bc4762bca3715c88106bc9b00c42e73eb3f26b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758555736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/d4e19732100c7739748f557bd6ab446a7fa35e56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758555736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/d4e19732100c7739748f557bd6ab446a7fa35e56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758555736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game features mild blood during combat and deals with emotional themes such as loss, grief, and coping with trauma."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Narrative</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/754d94a000375d1acf9112d04b3e8c3f.avif?t=1758555736\" width=1520 height=844 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a deeply emotional, story-driven journey, told through evocative visuals, haunting music, and subtle environmental storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill Yet Engaging Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akam